title: There is one round of reading, not a comment period or a meeting.
pid: cb093ead-8abb-45b1-82c8-faec51d97c8f
body: |2-
  Google, Oxide and Rust assume people who read in parallel over days.
  Here each reading is a mission, missions run one at a time, and the
  mind that wrote the plan is gone when the readings come back.
